      10 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استنبأ النَّبَأَ</span></b>  <i>He sought,</i> or <i>searched after,
information,</i> or <i>news.</i> (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَيَسْتَنْبِئُونَكَ أَحَقٌّ هُوَ</span>
(in the Kur, x. 54) means <i>And they will ask thee
to inform them,</i> [saying,] <i>Is it true?</i> (Bd.)

